# Diligent Zookeeper: a changeling is every creature type, Human among them, so Sizzling Changeling (Shapeshifter, 3/2) is not a
# "non-Human creature" and keeps its size (CR 205.3m, 702.73a), while Llanowar Elves are 3/3 beside the Zookeeper. On turn 4 Bot2 destroys
# the Zookeeper with Terror and the Elves are 1/1 again: the bonus lasts only while the Zookeeper is on the battlefield (CR 611.3a).

